# Errors point at the file's lines

Some prose that is not code, and a `sql` block that is prose too:

```sql
select * from nowhere
```

```olang {name: setup}
fn checked(n) = {
    if n > limit => raise(`${n} is past ${limit}`)
    n
}
```

```olang no-run
raise("a no-run cell never runs")
```

```olang
println(checked(2))
println(checked(5))
```
